      "headline": "NVIDIA Built Its AVO Coding Agent To Optimize CUDA GPU Kernels, And It Just Achieved A 100% Score On A Public Test Without Receiving Any Prior Instruction",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "NVIDIA has just demonstrated the growing importance of a good harness around a given AI model by allowing its AVO coding agent to take a stab at the ARC-AGI-3 public data set, where it managed to ace all 183 levels of the 25 publicly available games, and that too without receivin",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-22T08:03:50.413068+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a623f3777661214ebba0b580d809b3ddfb1dcd4c014c8502afa6dd982d0047f1",
          "excerpt": "NVIDIA has just demonstrated the growing importance of a good harness around a given AI model by allowing its AVO coding agent to take a stab at the ARC-AGI-3 public data set, where it managed to ace all 183 levels of the 25 publicly available games, and that too without receivin",
          "sentence_hash": "6caef40b8b398ec30c112c40d80052a06407a9d365369c4a92af3adac4576894",
          "anchors": [
            "here",
            "given",
            "without",
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "NVIDIA's AVO is a wrapper around Anthropic's Claude Opus 5 model, but where the Opus 5 scored just 30 percent on the ARC-AGI-3 public set, the AVO scored an unblemished 100 percent Before going further, let's first discuss what is an AI harness.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-22T08:03:50.413115+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a623f3777661214ebba0b580d809b3ddfb1dcd4c014c8502afa6dd982d0047f1",
          "excerpt": "NVIDIA's AVO is a wrapper around Anthropic's Claude Opus 5 model, but where the Opus 5 scored just 30 percent on the ARC-AGI-3 public set, the AVO scored an unblemished 100 percent Before going further, let's first discuss what is an AI harness.",
          "sentence_hash": "32b4b8c9415dab6300b4ac5935dffe7dfd38fead8082452468d96507936019e4",
          "anchors": [
            "here"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "In the convoluted world of artificial intelligence, a harness is a wrapper - an external layer of software - that is built around a given AI model.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-22T08:03:50.413143+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a623f3777661214ebba0b580d809b3ddfb1dcd4c014c8502afa6dd982d0047f1",
          "excerpt": "In the convoluted world of artificial intelligence, a harness is a wrapper - an external layer of software - that is built around a given AI model.",
          "sentence_hash": "7a95191b672ed9d281816c6efce7b8072e996ed6b941613f9ccd723c625d4b6a",
          "anchors": [
            "given"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Think of the model as the brain and the harness as the body, suit of armor, and tools that transform a generic text predictor into a problem solver.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-22T08:03:50.413168+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a623f3777661214ebba0b580d809b3ddfb1dcd4c014c8502afa6dd982d0047f1",
          "excerpt": "Think of the model as the brain and the harness as the body, suit of armor, and tools that transform a generic text predictor into a problem solver.",
          "sentence_hash": "e054962ddd9f0c04827e2f4fa76e3b34847f1a3d887020a500120fa183bd2559",
          "anchors": [
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "- Allows the AI model to create a self-correcting loop, where a complex problem is solved through trial and error.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-22T08:03:50.413194+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a623f3777661214ebba0b580d809b3ddfb1dcd4c014c8502afa6dd982d0047f1",
          "excerpt": "- Allows the AI model to create a self-correcting loop, where a complex problem is solved through trial and error.",
          "sentence_hash": "14a49565433b867db3e6f5d8d750e99ce7096b4e25bac01f8ace69f60a744e1e",
          "anchors": [
            "here"
          ]
        },
        {
